---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Hero from "../components/Hero.astro";
import Section from "../components/Section.astro";
import ProcessSteps from "../components/ProcessSteps.astro";
import FAQAccordion from "../components/FAQAccordion.astro";
// removed unused images for deleted sections
import aboutPortrait from "../assets/Image_20260509161325_9_79.jpg";
---

<Layout
	pageTitle="After Dark Studio | Hong Kong rental interiors"
	pageDescription="After Dark Studio helps renters in Hong Kong turn temporary spaces into homes that work for real life."
	headerTheme="dark"
>
	<div class="site-shell">
		<Hero />
	</div>

	<Section id="is-this-you" title="Is this you?">
		<div class="is-you-strip__inner">
			<!-- Heading provided by Section wrapper; removed duplicate -->
			<div class="is-you-strip__grid">
				<ul>
					<li>You rent a small flat in Hong Kong and it’s always felt a bit temporary – so you’ve never fully set it up to <em>support</em> you.</li>
					<li>You’re not a minimalist, but visual clutter and bad layout make you feel wired, tired or vaguely stressed at home.</li>
					<li>You already own “enough stuff”, yet the space never quite works: counters attract piles, chairs collect clothes, the entry is always chaos.</li>
				</ul>
				<ul>
					<li>You don’t want to become a different person. You want your home and systems to make it <em>easier</em> to be the way you are and still feel “tidy enough”.</li>
					<li>You care about waste and money – throwing everything out feels wrong, but you’re open to a few intentional additions if they really help your daily life.</li>
				</ul>
			</div>
			<p class="is-you-strip__closing">If you’re nodding along, you’re exactly who I design for. The goal isn’t perfection. It’s a home that quietly supports how you really live.</p>
		</div>
	</Section>

	<Section id="what-i-do" title="What I actually do">
		<div class="card">
			<h3>Not a “buy everything new” service</h3>
			<p>Most design services start with shopping lists. I start with what you already have.</p>
			<p>After Dark Studio is for people who:</p>
			<ul>
				<li>don’t want to waste money or create more clutter, and</li>
				<li>want their home to feel calmer and work better <em>before</em> they buy more.</li>
			</ul>
			<p>Together we will:</p>
			<ul>
				<li>re‑plan your layout and systems so your home fits how you really live,</li>
				<li>rearrange and edit what you already own,</li>
				<li>only add new pieces if they clearly solve a problem (light, storage, comfort) and can move with you.</li>
			</ul>
			<p>If you’re looking for a shopping buddy to redo everything from scratch, I’m probably not the right fit.</p>
		</div>
	</Section>

	<ProcessSteps />

	<Section id="investment" title="Investment">
		<div class="card">
			<p>I offer a focused, two‑session service for renters, creating micro‑solutions for your repeat problems – the chair that always collects clothes, the table that ends up buried, the corner you never use.</p>
			<p>Most projects for a whole small flat (studio / 1–2 bed) land in the <strong>mid‑HKD 4,000s</strong>. Single‑room projects are lower.</p>
			<p>On our free 15‑minute Home Fit Call, I’ll recommend the right option for your space and give you a clear quote before you decide.</p>
			<p class="pricing-cta"><a class="button button--primary" href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLScMhkQxJpi7S7oCcPvw5a082q0Zt38LkCtar3LjJriCU107GA/viewform" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Share your flat details</a></p>
		</div>
	</Section>

	<Section id="about" title="About">
		<div class="about-section__inner">
			<div class="about-section__copy card">
				<h2>I’m Drishti – a spatial designer based in Hong Kong</h2>
				<p>With a background in interior and scenic design for theatre, sets and installations, my favourite part has always been spatial planning – finding the exact placement of a bed, table or light that makes your body relax because the space finally works with you, not against you.</p>
				<p>I’m less interested in buying new decor, and more interested in:</p>
				<ul>
					<li>how your body moves through your home,</li>
					<li>what your nervous system needs to calm down, and</li>
					<li>how to make everyday tasks feel lighter through layout and systems.</li>
				</ul>
				<p>I’ve designed everything from 7,500 sq ft penthouses to tiny rentals and theatre sets, and I bring that same level of care to your one‑year rental so it feels designed specifically for you, not just “good enough for now”.</p>
				<p><a class="about-section__link" href="http://drishtichauhandesign.com/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">See more of my previous design work →</a></p>
			</div>

			<figure class="about-section__portrait">
				<img src={aboutPortrait.src} alt="Portrait of Drishti" />
			</figure>
		</div>
	</Section>

	<FAQAccordion />

	<Section id="ready" title="Ready for a space that fits how you really live?">
		<div class="card contact-cta">
			<p><a class="button button--primary" href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLScMhkQxJpi7S7oCcPvw5a082q0Zt38LkCtar3LjJriCU107GA/viewform" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Book a free 15‑minute Home Fit Call →</a></p>
			<p style="margin-top:0.75rem">Or WhatsApp me 3 photos: <a href="https://wa.me/85290543117" rel="noreferrer">+852 9054 3117</a></p>
		</div>
	</Section>



</Layout>

<style>
	#is-this-you {
		--section-bg: var(--bg);
		--section-heading: var(--heading);
		--section-text: var(--text);
		--section-accent: var(--accent-tan);
		--section-border: rgba(199, 148, 92, 0.2);
	}

	#what-i-do {
		--section-bg: var(--bg);
		--section-heading: var(--heading);
		--section-text: var(--text);
		--section-accent: var(--accent-teal);
		--section-border: rgba(31, 41, 51, 0.08);
	}

	#process {
		--section-bg: var(--bg);
		--section-heading: var(--heading);
		--section-text: var(--text);
		--section-accent: var(--accent-tan);
		--section-accent-2: var(--accent-teal);
		--section-border: rgba(199, 148, 92, 0.4);
		--section-border-2: rgba(59, 124, 130, 0.35);
		--section-surface: rgba(255, 250, 244, 0.78);
	}

	#investment {
		--section-bg: var(--bg);
		--section-heading: var(--heading);
		--section-text: var(--text);
		--section-accent: var(--accent-tan);
		--section-accent-text: var(--bg);
		--section-border-2: rgba(59, 124, 130, 0.35);
	}

	#about {
		--section-bg: var(--bg);
		--section-heading: var(--heading);
		--section-text: var(--text);
		--section-accent-link: var(--accent-teal);
		--section-accent: var(--accent-tan);
		--section-border-2: rgba(59, 124, 130, 0.28);
	}

	#faq {
		--section-bg: var(--bg);
		--section-heading: var(--heading);
		--section-text: var(--text);
		--section-accent: var(--accent-teal);
		--section-border: rgba(199, 148, 92, 0.2);
	}

	#ready {
		--section-bg: var(--accent-teal);
		--section-heading: var(--bg);
		--section-text: var(--bg);
		--section-accent: var(--accent-tan);
		--section-accent-text: var(--bg);
		--section-border: rgba(245, 240, 232, 0.18);
	}

	.hero-hero {
		padding: 1rem 0 3.5rem;
	}

	.hero-hero__content {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.25fr) minmax(300px, 0.85fr);
		gap: 1.5rem;
		align-items: start;
		padding: 2.5rem 0 1rem;
	}

	.hero-hero__copy {
		padding: 0.25rem 0;
	}

	.hero-hero h1 {
		margin: 0;
		max-width: 11ch;
		font-size: clamp(3.2rem, 6vw, 5.8rem);
		letter-spacing: -0.03em;
	}

	.hero-hero__subheading {
		margin-top: 1rem;
		font-size: clamp(1.2rem, 2vw, 1.55rem);
		color: var(--heading);
		max-width: 24ch;
	}

	.hero-hero__intro {
		margin-top: 1rem;
		font-size: 1.1rem;
		max-width: 48ch;
		color: var(--text);
	}

	.hero-hero__actions {
		margin-top: 1.5rem;
	}

	.is-you-strip {
		background: var(--section-bg, var(--bg));
		color: var(--section-text, var(--text));
		padding: 2.5rem 0;
	}

	.is-you-strip__inner {
		display: grid;
		gap: 1rem;
		align-items: start;
		border-left: 3px solid var(--section-accent, var(--accent-tan));
		padding-left: 1rem;
	}

	.is-you-strip__heading {
		display: inline-block;
		border-bottom: 3px solid var(--section-accent, var(--accent-1));
		padding-bottom: 0.35rem;
		font-size: 1.05rem;
		margin: 0 0 0.35rem 0;
		color: var(--section-heading, var(--heading));
		font-weight: 700;
	}

	.is-you-strip__grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
		gap: 1rem 2rem;
		padding: 0;
		margin: 0 0 0.5rem 0;
	}

	.is-you-strip__grid ul {
		margin: 0;
		padding-left: 1rem;
		display: grid;
		gap: 0.6rem;
		color: var(--section-text, var(--text));
	}

	.is-you-strip__grid li {
		line-height: 1.45;
	}

	.is-you-strip__grid li::marker {
		color: var(--section-accent, var(--accent-1));
	}

	.is-you-strip__closing {
		margin-top: 0.75rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		color: var(--section-heading, var(--heading));
	}

	#what-i-do .card {
		background: var(--section-bg, var(--bg));
		border: 1px solid var(--section-border, rgba(31, 41, 51, 0.08));
		box-shadow: none;
		color: var(--section-text, var(--text));
	}

	#what-i-do h3 {
		color: var(--section-heading, var(--heading));
	}

	#what-i-do .card p,
	#what-i-do .card li,
	#what-i-do .card strong,
	#what-i-do .card em {
		color: var(--section-text, var(--text));
	}

	#what-i-do li::marker {
		color: var(--section-accent, var(--accent-teal));
	}

	#investment .card {
		background: var(--section-bg, var(--bg));
		border: 1px solid var(--section-border-2, rgba(59, 124, 130, 0.35));
		box-shadow: 0 12px 28px rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.06);
	}

	#investment p,
	#investment li {
		color: var(--section-text, var(--text));
	}

	#investment .button--primary {
		background: var(--section-accent, var(--accent-tan));
		color: var(--section-accent-text, var(--bg));
	}

	.what-does {
		background: var(--bg);
		padding: 2rem 0 3rem;
	}

	.what-does__grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) 420px;
		gap: 1.5rem;
		align-items: start;
	}

	.what-does__copy {
		padding: 1.25rem;
		background: transparent;
		border: none;
		box-shadow: none;
		color: var(--text) !important;
	}

	.what-does__copy h2 {
		margin-top: 0.5rem;
		color: var(--heading);
	}

	.what-does__copy p {
		color: var(--text);
	}

	.why-bother {
		background: rgba(224, 122, 95, 0.24);
		padding: 2.5rem 0;
	}

	.why-bother__inner {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.1fr) minmax(280px, 0.9fr);
		gap: 1.25rem;
		align-items: stretch;
	}

	.why-bother__copy {
		padding: 1.5rem;
		background: rgba(245, 240, 232, 0.72);
		border: 1px solid rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.08);
		box-shadow: 0 18px 40px rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.08);
		color: var(--text);
	}

	.why-bother__copy h2 {
		margin-top: 0.45rem;
		font-size: clamp(2rem, 3vw, 3rem);
		color: var(--heading);
	}

	.why-bother__copy p {
		margin-top: 1rem;
		color: var(--text);
	}

	.why-bother__list {
		display: grid;
		gap: 0.85rem;
		margin: 1rem 0 0;
		padding-left: 1.1rem;
		color: var(--text);
	}

	.why-bother__list li::marker {
		color: var(--accent-1);
	}

	.why-bother__photo {
		margin: 0;
		display: grid;
	}

	.why-bother__photo img {
		width: 100%;
		height: 100%;
		min-height: 320px;
		object-fit: cover;
		border-radius: 18px;
		box-shadow: 0 18px 40px rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.16);
	}

	.about-section {
		background: var(--bg);
		padding: 2.5rem 0 3rem;
	}

	.about-section__inner {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.15fr) minmax(260px, 0.85fr);
		gap: 1.25rem;
		align-items: stretch;
	}

	.about-section__copy {
		padding: 1.5rem;
		background: var(--section-bg, var(--bg));
		border: 1px solid var(--section-border-2, rgba(59, 124, 130, 0.28));
		box-shadow: 0 18px 40px rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.08);
		color: var(--section-text, var(--text));
	}

	.about-section__copy h2 {
		margin-top: 0.45rem;
		font-size: clamp(2rem, 3vw, 3rem);
		color: var(--section-heading, var(--heading));
	}

	.about-section__copy p {
		margin-top: 1rem;
		color: var(--section-text, var(--text));
	}

	.about-section__link {
		display: inline-flex;
		margin-top: 1.15rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		color: var(--section-accent-link, var(--accent-teal));
	}

	.about-section__link:hover,
	.about-section__link:focus-visible {
		color: var(--section-accent, var(--accent-tan));
		outline: none;
	}

	.about-section__portrait {
		margin: 0;
		display: grid;
	}

	.about-section__portrait img {
		width: 100%;
		height: 100%;
		min-height: 340px;
		object-fit: cover;
		object-position: center;
		border-radius: 18px;
		box-shadow: 0 18px 40px rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.16);
	}

	.photo-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
		grid-auto-rows: 140px;
		gap: 0.5rem;
		align-items: center;
	}

	.photo-grid img {
		width: 100%;
		height: 100%;
		object-fit: cover;
		border-radius: 10px;
		display: block;
	}

	.photo-grid img:first-child {
		grid-row: span 2;
		height: 100%;
	}

	.how-it-works {
		background: var(--section-bg, var(--bg));
		border-top: 1px solid var(--section-border, rgba(199, 148, 92, 0.4));
		padding: 2.5rem 0 3rem;
	}

	.how-it-works__inner {
		display: grid;
		gap: 1.25rem;
	}

	.how-it-works__intro {
		display: grid;
		gap: 0.6rem;
		max-width: 56rem;
	}

	.how-it-works__intro h2 {
		color: var(--heading);
		font-size: clamp(2rem, 3vw, 3rem);
	}

	.how-it-works__intro p,
	.timeline__content p,
	.timeline__content li,
	.how-it-works__cta p {
		color: var(--text);
	}

	.timeline {
		display: grid;
		gap: 0.7rem;
	}

	.timeline__item {
		background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.42);
		border: 1px solid rgba(199, 148, 92, 0.25);
		border-radius: 16px;
		overflow: hidden;
		transition:
			border-color 180ms ease,
			box-shadow 180ms ease,
			transform 180ms ease;
	}

	.timeline__item[open] {
		box-shadow: 0 14px 32px rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.08);
		transform: translateY(-1px);
		border-color: rgba(199, 148, 92, 0.4);
	}

	.timeline__item summary {
		list-style: none;
		cursor: pointer;
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: auto 1fr auto;
		gap: 0.7rem;
		align-items: center;
		padding: 0.9rem 1rem;
		color: var(--heading);
		font-size: 1.12rem;
	}

	.timeline__item summary::-webkit-details-marker {
		display: none;
	}

	.timeline__item summary::after {
		content: "+";
		font-size: 1.2rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		color: var(--accent-1);
		transition: transform 180ms ease;
	}

	.timeline__item[open] summary::after {
		content: "–";
		transform: translateY(-1px);
	}

	.timeline__step {
		display: inline-flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
		min-width: 4.35rem;
		padding: 0.3rem 0.65rem;
		border-radius: 999px;
		background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(199, 148, 92, 0.18), rgba(59, 124, 130, 0.12));
		font-size: 0.84rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		color: var(--heading);
		letter-spacing: 0.04em;
	}

	.timeline__title {
		line-height: 1.15;
	}

	.timeline__content {
		display: grid;
		gap: 0.7rem;
		padding: 0 1rem 1rem;
		animation: timeline-reveal 220ms ease;
	}

	.timeline__content ul {
		margin: 0;
		padding-left: 1rem;
		display: grid;
		gap: 0.5rem;
	}

	.timeline__content strong {
		font-weight: 700;
	}

		/* FAQ section (light background, accordion) */
		.faq-section {
			background: var(--section-bg, var(--bg));
			border-top: 1px solid var(--section-border, rgba(31, 41, 51, 0.08));
			padding: 2.5rem 0 3rem;
		}

		.faq-section__inner {
			display: grid;
			gap: 1rem;
		}

		.faq-section__intro h2 {
			margin-top: 0.4rem;
			font-size: clamp(2rem, 3vw, 3rem);
			color: var(--section-heading, var(--heading));
		}

		.faq-section__list {
			display: grid;
			gap: 0.7rem;
		}

		.faq-item {
			background: var(--section-surface, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.74));
			border: 1px solid var(--section-border, rgba(31, 41, 51, 0.08));
			border-radius: 16px;
			overflow: hidden;
			box-shadow: 0 12px 28px rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.06);
			transition:
				border-color 320ms ease,
				box-shadow 320ms ease,
				transform 320ms ease;
		}

		.faq-item[open] {
			border-color: var(--section-border-2, rgba(199, 148, 92, 0.28));
			box-shadow: 0 16px 32px rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.09);
			transform: translateY(-1px);
		}

		.faq-item summary {
			list-style: none;
			cursor: pointer;
			display: grid;
			grid-template-columns: 1fr auto;
			gap: 0.8rem;
			align-items: center;
			padding: 1rem 1.1rem;
			color: var(--section-heading, var(--heading));
			font-size: 1.08rem;
		}

		.faq-item summary::-webkit-details-marker {
			display: none;
		}

		.faq-item summary::after {
			content: "+";
			font-size: 1.2rem;
			font-weight: 700;
			color: var(--section-accent, var(--accent-1));
			transition: transform 320ms ease;
		}

		.faq-item[open] summary::after {
			content: "–";
			transform: translateY(-1px);
		}

		.faq-item__content {
			display: grid;
			gap: 0.7rem;
			padding: 0 1.1rem 1rem;
			animation: timeline-reveal 420ms ease;
		}

		.faq-item__content p,
		.faq-item__content li {
			color: var(--section-text, var(--text));
		}

		.faq-item__content ul {
			margin: 0;
			padding-left: 1rem;
			display: grid;
			gap: 0.45rem;
		}

		.faq-item__content strong {
			font-weight: 700;
		}

		/* Pricing section */
		.pricing-section {
			background: var(--section-bg, var(--bg));
			border-top: 1px solid var(--section-border, rgba(31, 41, 51, 0.04));
			padding: 2.5rem 0 3rem;
		}

		.pricing-section__inner {
			display: grid;
			gap: 1rem;
		}

		.pricing-cards {
			display: grid;
			grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
			gap: 1rem;
			align-items: start;
		}

		.pricing-card {
			background: var(--section-surface, rgba(255,255,255,0.88));
			border: 1px solid var(--section-border, rgba(31,41,51,0.06));
			padding: 1.25rem;
			border-radius: 14px;
			box-shadow: 0 12px 28px rgba(30,41,59,0.06);
		}

		.pricing-card h3 {
			margin: 0 0 0.5rem 0;
			font-size: 1.15rem;
			color: var(--section-heading, var(--heading));
		}

		.pricing-card p {
			color: var(--section-text, var(--text));
			margin: 0 0 0.75rem 0;
		}

		.pricing-card ul {
			margin: 0;
			padding-left: 1rem;
			display: grid;
			gap: 0.4rem;
			color: var(--section-text, var(--text));
		}

		.pricing-note {
			margin-top: 1rem;
			color: var(--section-text, var(--text));
		}

		.pricing-cta {
			margin-top: 1.25rem;
		}

		@media (max-width: 900px) {
			.pricing-cards {
				grid-template-columns: 1fr;
			}
		}

	.how-it-works__ending {
		margin: 0.15rem 0 0;
		padding: 0 0.25rem;
		font-size: 1.02rem;
		font-weight: 600;
		color: var(--text);
	}

	.how-it-works__cta {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: space-between;
		gap: 1rem;
		padding: 1rem 1.1rem;
